Z||000008||Fformula88||11-29-2001||12:06 PM||||This is when its time to get a little louder with Wal Mart.  As said, demand to see a manager.  There is nor eason in the world they should take it back.  Its not like they won't find someone else to buy it!  I think you ran into a lazy counter person who couldn't be bothered with processing the return.<P>Trying another location is another good idea!  Just tell them you were in the area and stopped instead of driving all the way to the original location!<P>What ever you do, stay persistant!  Asking for the manager with a prgressively loud voice doesn't hurt since it usually will attract a manager.||||reg||1
