Z||000014||Voytek||11-29-2001||12:44 PM||||Hey, when I used to work at K-mart (a few years back) some old witch came in with a used toaster over wanting a refund.  Normally that wouldn't be a problem, except she had no receipt, no box, this was an older model AND there were food crumbs inside.  She could've found it in the trash somewhere.<P>To my protest, we gave her a refund.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><P>WalMart usually takes back anything, receipt or not.  Keep trying.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/voyteks_sig2.gif"> ||||reg||1
